    {
      "source": "Map from the given <a href=\"../../messaging/MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a> to the specified target message.",
      "translation": "将给定的 `<a href=\"../../messaging/MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a>` 映射到指定的目标消息。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Map from the given target message to abstracted <a href=\"../../messaging/MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的目标消息映射到抽象的<a href=\"../../messaging/MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>jmsMessage</code> - the native target message",
      "translation": "<code>jmsMessage</code> - 原生目标消息",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Constants for the JMS API headers are defined in <a href=\"JmsHeaders.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jms.support\"><code>JmsHeaders</code></a>.\nNote that most of the JMS headers are read-only: the JMSDestination,\nJMSDeliveryMode, JMSExpiration, JMSMessageID, JMSPriority, JMSRedelivered\nand JMSTimestamp flags are only copied <em>from</em> a JMS Message. Those\nvalues will <em>not</em> be passed along from a Message to an outbound\nJMS Message.",
      "translation": "JMS API 标头的常量定义在 <a href=\"JmsHeaders.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jms.support\"><code>JmsHeaders</code></a> 中。请注意，大多数 JMS 标头是只读的：JMSDestination、JMSDeliveryMode、JMSExpiration、JMSMessageID、JMSPriority、JMSRedelivered 和 JMSTimestamp 标志仅从 JMS Message <em>复制</em>而来。这些值将 <em>不会</em>从 Message 传递到出站 JMS Message。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert <a href=\"../../messaging/MessageHeaders.html#CONTENT_TYPE\"><code>MessageHeaders.CONTENT_TYPE</code></a> to <code>content_type</code> for JMS compliance.",
      "translation": "将 `<a href=\"../../messaging/MessageHeaders.html#CONTENT_TYPE\"><code>MessageHeaders.CONTENT_TYPE</code></a>` 转换为 `content_type` 以符合 JMS 规范。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert the JMS-compliant <code>content_type</code> to <a href=\"../../messaging/MessageHeaders.html#CONTENT_TYPE\"><code>MessageHeaders.CONTENT_TYPE</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将符合 JMS 的<code>content_type</code>转换为<a href=\"../../messaging/MessageHeaders.html#CONTENT_TYPE\"><code>MessageHeaders.CONTENT_TYPE</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation copies JMS API headers (for example, JMSReplyTo) to and from\n<a href=\"../../messaging/Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Messages</code></a>. Any user-defined\nproperties will also be copied from a JMS Message to a Message, and any\nother headers on a Message (beyond the JMS API headers) will likewise\nbe copied to a JMS Message. Those other headers will be copied to the\ngeneral properties of a JMS Message whereas the JMS API headers are passed\nto the appropriate setter methods (for example, setJMSReplyTo).",
      "translation": "此实现将 JMS API 标头（例如，JMSReplyTo）复制到和从 `<a href=\"../../messaging/Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Messages</code></a>`。任何用户定义的属性也将从一个 JMS Message 复制到 Message，而 Message 上的任何其他标头（超出 JMS API 标头之外）同样将被复制到 JMS Message。这些其他标头将复制到 JMS Message 的通用属性中，而 JMS API 标头则传递给相应的 setter 方法（例如，setJMSReplyTo）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
